Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.77,0:00:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,快看这个  鹰
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.36,0:00:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,这座岛的地图?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.74,0:00:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.95,0:00:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我想去这个打叉的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.95,0:00:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,那里有什么东西吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.33,0:00:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,宝藏
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.37,0:00:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,骗人的吧  怎么可能有这种东西
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.25,0:00:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,所以才要去亲眼验证啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.04,0:00:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么要找我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.46,0:00:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你运动神经看起来很好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.84,0:00:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,就算遇到什么危险
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.47,0:00:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉也有办法应对
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.10,0:00:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,既然如此  我给你推荐个更有用的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.31,0:00:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.14,0:00:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿咻
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.35,0:00:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我乃燕
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.31,0:00:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你从哪冒出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.77,0:00:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,刚刚你是从树上跳下来的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.32,0:00:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,此乃秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.57,0:00:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,这家伙是忍者哦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.32,0:00:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你们几个
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.91,0:00:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,好像在打什么不好的主意
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.37,0:01:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,吓到了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.58,0:01:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.96,0:01:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫隼人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.33,0:01:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,作为班长  实在没办法对你们视而不见啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.96,0:01:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.96,0:01:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我想想  你是叫雀吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.51,0:01:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我来帮忙的话
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.97,0:01:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,也能分到宝物吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.60,0:01:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,当然  大家一起去找吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.25,0:03:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.42,0:03:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,来了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.05,0:03:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.76,0:03:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,还是肯来了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.18,0:03:25.18,Comment,,0,0,0,,看招看招…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.80,0:03:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,是  是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.26,0:03:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我们找到的这座小岛的秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.68,0:03:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,就装在这个宝箱里了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.10,0:03:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,然后我们都各自上了锁
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.86,0:03:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,四把锁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.15,0:03:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,没错  因为我们有五个人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.98,0:03:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,五个人把钥匙藏了起来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.16,0:03:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,但是锁只有四把啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.91,0:03:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,因为作为队长的我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.12,0:03:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,是负责保管这本笔记
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.33,0:03:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,所以就没有藏钥匙
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.20,0:03:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,队长是你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.00,0:03:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,有  有什么关系嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.08,0:03:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,成员都有谁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.63,0:03:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,小鸡或者狗吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.46,0:03:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,咩!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.17,0:04:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,羊?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.01,0:04:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,是我生气了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.38,0:04:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我可是正儿八经的队长啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.39,0:04:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,把钥匙全部集齐  打开宝箱的话
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.27,0:04:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,就能得知小岛的秘密了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.81,0:04:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,所以那个秘密是什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.73,0:04:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,过来过来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.61,0:04:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,这个嘛…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.45,0:04:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,才不告诉你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.28,0:04:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,总而言之
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.95,0:04:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,四把钥匙的下落
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.87,0:04:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,要解开笔记上的提示才能知道
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.37,0:04:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,暗号吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.04,0:04:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,不过这都过去十年了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.25,0:04:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,不管藏在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.88,0:04:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我都不觉得能保持当年的状态了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.88,0:04:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,这个「海底上」如果指的是大海海底的话
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.64,0:04:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,那就根本没法拿到吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.68,0:04:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得大家都是好好考虑过才藏起来的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.23,0:04:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,比如说…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.06,0:04:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,实在看不出会有钥匙藏着啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.52,0:04:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.61,0:05:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,「海神」到底是什么意思呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.65,0:05:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,「海神」如果指的是大海的神
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.40,0:05:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,那应该会有什么雕像之类的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.11,0:05:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我绕着小岛转了一圈
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.24,0:05:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,没发现类似的东西呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.20,0:05:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,海神…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.66,0:05:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,大海的神…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.54,0:05:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,守护大海的…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.08,0:05:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,要说守护大海的话
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.71,0:05:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,可能是灯塔吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.50,0:05:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.97,0:05:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,姆啾?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.13,0:05:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你是…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.97,0:05:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,是你认识的人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.10,0:05:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,算是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.18,0:05:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我是鹰原羽依里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.85,0:05:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,这位是久岛鸥咩…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.10,0:05:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,咩?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.73,0:05:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,喂喂  不对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.07,0:05:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,初次见面
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.28,0:05:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我是久岛鸥
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.69,0:05:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.99,0:05:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我是紬·文德斯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.36,0:05:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你在收集垃圾吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.99,0:05:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,真了不起
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.91,0:05:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我也来帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.66,0:05:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,唉?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.29,0:05:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,那我也来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.37,0:05:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,姆啾…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.00,0:06:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你们都是好人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.55,0:06:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,这样啊  你们在找钥匙
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.93,0:06:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我没看到过呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.05,0:06:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗  我想也是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.81,0:06:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,这么说的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.47,0:06:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,难道是在灯塔周围的海底吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.10,0:06:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,真是那样的话  可以宣告没戏了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.23,0:06:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,海神守护的海底上…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.48,0:06:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,说不定是有着别的意思
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.62,0:06:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你说的是「怪人」吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.62,0:06:37.16,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs30}注 : 「怪人」与「海神」同音
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.54,0:06:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,战队特摄里会出现的那种
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.42,0:06:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,对  没错
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.88,0:06:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,应该不至于是怪人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.09,0:06:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,不过  如果除了海神
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.55,0:06:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,海底也有别的意思的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.09,0:06:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.14,0:06:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,请问这里有字典吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.14,0:06:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,有的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.56,0:06:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,真的会在这种地方吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.27,0:07:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我的推理没错的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.99,0:07:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.03,0:07:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,找到钥匙了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.53,0:07:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,果然没错
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.62,0:07:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.42,0:07:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,「阶梯」也就是楼梯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.42,0:07:26.59,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs35}注 : 「阶梯」与「海底」同音
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.09,0:07:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,「海神」守护的「阶梯」
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.80,0:07:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,就是指供奉大海守护神神社的石梯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.22,0:07:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我可没听说过这种说法
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.43,0:07:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了  钥匙还在
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.52,0:07:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.73,0:07:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,多亏了羽依里
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.36,0:07:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的  希望能给些简单的提示啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.11,0:07:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,就是就是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.49,0:07:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你送我过来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.62,0:07:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,那明天见了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.16,0:08:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,也有可能是后天哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.33,0:08:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.71,0:08:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,就算后天不行  那还有大后天
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.13,0:08:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,无论去到哪里  那都还有明天
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.38,0:08:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,冲啊冲啊加油哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.64,0:08:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,这是在唱什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.81,0:08:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你不知道吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.18,0:08:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.10,0:08:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,总而言之  等你什么时候又有兴致了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.73,0:08:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,再来帮我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.28,0:08:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.28,0:08:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,明天见
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.67,0:08:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,这里也没有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.13,0:08:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,「在看门狗沉睡的冥府入口」
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.17,0:08:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,活了十年以上的狗吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.01,0:08:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,这座岛上还剩几只呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.93,0:09:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,或许是这里
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.73,0:09:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,火葬场?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.31,0:09:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,啊  我明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.15,0:09:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,冥府入口指的是…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.11,0:09:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然有点不尊重逝者
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.24,0:09:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,失礼了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.79,0:09:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.70,0:09:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,找到了  羽依里
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.08,0:09:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,第二把钥匙
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.46,0:09:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.13,0:09:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,下一把
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.51,0:09:41.14,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs28}注 : 巴西利斯克（Basilisk）又叫蛇尾鸡或者有翼蜥蜴  在希腊和欧洲的传说里  是所有蛇类之王  并且能以眼神致人于死
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.51,0:09:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,「在巴西利斯克聚集的沙漠里」
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.51,0:09:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,巴西利斯克是长得像鸟的怪物吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.02,0:09:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,鸟群聚集的…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.40,0:09:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,会不会是指的是鸡舍之类的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.94,0:09:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这个
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.03,0:09:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,养鸡的人家?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.32,0:09:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我记得是有几家
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.66,0:10:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,最好是养得很多的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.41,0:10:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我想想
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.24,0:10:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是鸣濑家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.50,0:10:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,他家有一间很大的鸡舍  应该养了很多
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.88,0:10:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,是  是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.05,0:10:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,鸣濑?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.42,0:10:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,之前在小卖铺前遇到过吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.84,0:10:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,是她啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.10,0:10:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你们关系都好到能去她家了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.43,0:10:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,真有两下子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.69,0:10:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,算是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.90,0:10:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,说到鸣濑家的白羽
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.36,0:10:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,可是我上岛以来的老相识了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.61,0:10:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,真行啊你…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.32,0:10:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,打扰了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.91,0:10:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,有人在家吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.21,0:10:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,有事?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.59,0:10:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,那  那个
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.96,0:10:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫鹰原羽依里
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.67,0:10:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,不认识
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.88,0:11:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,呃  那啥…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.39,0:11:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,白羽在家吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.76,0:11:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,白羽?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.43,0:11:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,叫得这么亲
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.06,0:11:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你是什么人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.85,0:11:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是她的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.07,0:11:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,一群外人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.45,0:11:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,根本不行嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.91,0:11:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的认识她吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.66,0:11:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不知道她家有这么个老爷子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.08,0:11:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我说  那孩子穿的是校服吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.71,0:11:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.63,0:11:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,只要穿成那样
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.09,0:11:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,老爷爷会不会相信我们呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.55,0:11:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,把我们当做她在学校的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.43,0:11:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,态度可能会变一些吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.14,0:11:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你想干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.35,0:11:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,有办法拿到吗  校服
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.90,0:11:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,苍
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.98,0:11:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,把你的校服借给我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.74,0:12:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,啥
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.28,0:12:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,把你的校服借给我
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.28,0:12:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么  不行
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.12,0:12:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.41,0:12:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我的朋友很憧憬
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.45,0:12:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,她说特别可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.25,0:12:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,哪有…  我也不是偶像什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.88,0:12:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,被人憧憬的话也不知道怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.34,0:12:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我说的是校服
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.67,0:12:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我…我知道啦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.26,0:12:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,这样我也是梦幻的女学生了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.89,0:12:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来挺紧啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.10,0:12:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,特别是胸…咳
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.64,0:12:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,胸咳?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.89,0:12:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你在说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.73,0:12:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,没…没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.15,0:12:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你就当做突发恶疾吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.86,0:12:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,打扰了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.15,0:12:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么  又是你们啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.45,0:12:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.58,0:12:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,白羽  你朋友来了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.51,0:13:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,呃…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.51,0:13:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,不  也不至于呃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.22,0:13:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.26,0:13:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.39,0:13:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我是久岛鸥
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.43,0:13:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.06,0:13:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.18,0:13:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,打扰了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.69,0:13:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,那么看起来能藏东西的地方…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.28,0:13:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,有了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.16,0:13:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,有个女孩子呢  还是裸体
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.45,0:13:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你要找的就是那个吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.08,0:13:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,不…不是的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.04,0:13:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是第三把了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.50,0:13:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.05,0:13:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.59,0:13:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,这是打开藏有小岛秘密宝箱的钥匙
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.27,0:13:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,听起来很有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.64,0:13:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.48,0:13:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,那要不要一起来寻宝
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.57,0:14:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.86,0:14:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,突然这么叫她肯定会不知所措吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.78,0:14:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,她一直都是那样的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.66,0:14:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不用在意的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.91,0:14:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,不过怎么说呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.62,0:14:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,是叫胡须猫团吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.62,0:14:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我大概知道为什么会选你当队长了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.75,0:14:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,是…是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.88,0:14:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你有一股莫名的行动力
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.84,0:14:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,哪有  你太夸我了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.80,0:14:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.43,0:14:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,想要交朋友罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.97,0:14:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,以前的我内向到不敢和人搭话
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.06,0:14:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,10年前  父母担心这样的我
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.02,0:14:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,所以把我送到了夏令营
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.11,0:14:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,一开始我特别不愿意
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.90,0:14:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,周围的人都建成自己的圈子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.53,0:14:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,而我却没法融入其中
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.45,0:14:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,就在那时  我在爸爸的房间发现了一幅地图
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.12,0:14:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我爸爸是学者
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.12,0:15:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,他好像在调查这座小岛的历史
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.92,0:15:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,那幅地图被小心地锁在抽屉的最里面
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.21,0:15:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,地图上有个红叉的图案
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.80,0:15:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,旁边有简单的注释
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.89,0:15:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Treasure
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.10,0:15:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,就是宝藏
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.47,0:15:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,但是要去那里需要翻过山
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.23,0:15:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,就算我想去  大人们肯定会反对
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.02,0:15:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,直接我找了或者试着找了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.45,0:15:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,真现实啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.12,0:15:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,他的名字是鹰
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.91,0:15:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然有点可怕但很擅长运动
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.33,0:15:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,接着燕  隼人  雀也加入了我们
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.75,0:15:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,变成了5人的团体
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.05,0:15:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.26,0:15:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么在意的地方吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.97,0:15:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我似乎有过类似的经历
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.26,0:15:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.68,0:15:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,看来羽依里也探险过呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.47,0:15:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,说不定呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.19,0:16:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,「在海雕居住的天空城堡里」吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.41,0:16:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的推理越来越准了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.66,0:16:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,这样就第四把了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.17,0:16:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,对  钥匙全都找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.88,0:16:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,羽依里
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.47,0:16:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,起床啦  羽依里
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.89,0:16:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,已经早晨了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.90,0:16:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,早上好  羽依里
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.90,0:16:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,早…上好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.23,0:16:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.69,0:16:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,因为是我才让羽依里受伤的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.20,0:16:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,所以作为赔礼来照顾羽依里一段时间
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.53,0:17:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你的好意
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.75,0:17:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,但这身打扮是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.66,0:17:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟镜子阿姨说想来帮忙…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.46,0:17:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,她就对我说穿这个吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.47,0:17:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样  很合身吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.14,0:17:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,是…是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.97,0:17:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,是挺合身的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.47,0:17:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.14,0:17:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,那我从今天开始加油啦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.75,0:17:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,她真能干啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.67,0:17:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.67,0:17:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,羽依里  我来给你搓背哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.43,0:17:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.76,0:17:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,这还问为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.72,0:18:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,当然是来帮忙的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.06,0:18:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,但你是…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.52,0:18:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,不用那么害羞
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.10,0:18:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,反正裹着毛巾吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.02,0:18:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,没裹
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.19,0:18:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,那…反正机会难得就帮你搓个背吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.65,0:18:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,要裹上毛巾哦…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.03,0:18:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.37,0:18:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,难道不是不在意吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.50,0:18:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,果然还是抱歉  我做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.17,0:18:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,那么  我要打开宝箱了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.89,0:18:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.64,0:18:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,这是你之前提到过的地图吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.44,0:18:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.44,0:18:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了  还在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.69,0:18:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,鸥…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.32,0:18:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,其实我本来以为很难找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.28,0:19:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,但是有羽依里的帮助
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.41,0:19:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我才能找到它
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.58,0:19:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你  羽依里
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.79,0:19:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.63,0:19:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,那么到底是什么东西呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.05,0:19:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,就是你们找到的东西  小岛的秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.09,0:19:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我还以为就放在这个宝箱里
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.43,0:19:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我们找到的东西可装不进这个箱子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.14,0:19:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,有那么大吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.90,0:19:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,特别大的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.73,0:19:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,那可真是厉害的财宝
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.28,0:19:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,可厉害了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.53,0:19:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,那到底是…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.99,0:19:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你看就写在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.37,0:19:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,船?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.41,0:19:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.12,0:19:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟这里是岛  有船也不奇怪吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.08,0:19:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,不不不
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.92,0:19:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,可不是一般的船
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.83,0:19:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.17,0:19:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.38,0:19:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我可不会再上同样的当
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.09,0:20:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,吊起我兴趣然后说才不告诉你对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.14,0:20:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经看穿了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.14,0:20:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,这次我是真打算告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.89,0:20:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,什么  是真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.52,0:20:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,真的真的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.89,0:20:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,那我很想听
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.44,0:20:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.11,0:20:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,那我就告诉你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.36,0:20:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,那我重新开始说
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.74,0:20:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我们沿着地图  去向小岛偏僻的角落
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.45,0:20:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,翻过大山  穿过洞窟
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.29,0:20:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,真是一趟漫长的旅途
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.67,0:20:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,然后我们找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.55,0:20:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,海盗船
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.93,0:20:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.05,0:20:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,海盗船是那种
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.06,0:20:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,画着骷髅记号的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.56,0:20:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,对的  就是那种海盗船
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.90,0:20:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,有骷髅记号
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.56,0:20:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,像是在欧洲那种地方的船
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.49,0:21:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你骗人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.69,0:21:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,没骗人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.61,0:21:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,那时我们找到了船
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.03,0:21:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,但是遇到了一些情况
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.54,0:21:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,需要立即返回
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.66,0:21:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,然后第二天夏令营也结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.46,0:21:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,大家就各奔东西了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.00,0:21:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是说  你们发现之后就直接离开了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.09,0:21:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.22,0:21:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你说的是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.68,0:21:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,船现在说不定还在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.97,0:21:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,一定还在的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.52,0:21:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,那一天  发现海盗船的我们做了约定
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.81,0:21:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,约好10年后  再一起寻找那艘船
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.52,0:21:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,然后就分开了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.73,0:21:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你现在又来寻找吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.32,0:21:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,就在10年后的这个夏天
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.45,0:21:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.95,0:21:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,钥匙和地图都还在
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.08,0:21:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我一定要去
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.92,0:22:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,再一次去到那个有海盗船的地方
Comment: 0,0:00:00.98,0:00:00.98,Comment,,0,0,0,,
